{"id": "60205", "title": "妻不如窃", "author": "懒懒小Q", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 21, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60205.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／正剧\r\n关键字：戚旭南 　秦曼芝 　都市言情 \r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n资料夹列表\r\n第一章 宅院深深 \r\n第二章 羊遇到狼\r\n第三章 初开情窦\r\n第四章 情陷两难\r\n第五章 最终的爱\r\n第六章 亲亲宝贝 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n她是他的妻子，但他却不爱她。为了仇恨，他娶了她，却不好好珍惜她，在新婚之夜，他用极端的手段替她破身，然后，消失在黑夜中……\r\n他是她的丈夫，但她不爱他。为了救赎，她忍受一切，在没有爱情的宅院里，寂寞的生活著，直到老太太的去世。\r\n终于，她决定重新生活，自由生活。但他不许，因为她是他的财产，更因为，他突然发现，他渐渐的爱上这个不愿意继续成为他妻子的女人……", "base": "files/article/html/60/60205", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "8827178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "8827180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "8827183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8827185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8827187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "8827190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "8827192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "8827195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "8827196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "8827197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "8827199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "8827206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "8827208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "8827211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "8827214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "8827216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "8827218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "8827221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-111", "file": "8827224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "112-118", "file": "8827228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "119-123完结", "file": "8827231.html", "available": false}]}